any ways."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her mannerisms and naivete may suggest that she is a very young lady, but unconfirmed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is pure and kind to everyone, and she will suddenly hold your hand and look you straight in the eye. She is a natural captivating personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has an unusually devoted fan base of elderly people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her hobby is reading."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Accompanying magical creature: Lop (rabbit)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c98854"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりほんわかなお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"グループ内では（あざと）可愛い担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メンバーもプライベートのことは把握していない。色々、謎に包まれた女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物腰や世間知らずさから、かなりのお嬢様なのではという説も（未確認）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"純粋で誰に対しても優しく、いきなりギュッて手を握ってまっすぐ目を見つめてきたりなど、ナチュラルに人の心を奪ってくるような人たらしな素質がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異様に熱心な老人のファンがいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は読書。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23555","sourceWorkId":"31399","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりお上品な、『けもの道』のうさぎさん担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「真っ白ふわふわのうさぎさん」が決まり文句。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あざと(？)可愛い、うさぎ魔法少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"品のある振る舞いは落ち着き、隠しきれない世間知らず感からお嬢様説は根強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ファンクラブに鬼推しウザ古参ファン(じじい)がいるため、実は人気が伸びていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(というよりファンがおおっぴらに好きと言いづらい)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"邪魔になってるぞじじいと、そろそろ誰かが言ってあげるべき。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『TOKYO NEW-DOLL FESTIVAL』に関しては、規模に戸惑いつつも「みんなの夢のため」と前向き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方では、疲れた表情を見せることが増えていたりも……？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23555","sourceWorkId":"33694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりほんわかなお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"グループ内では（あざと）可愛い担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メンバーもプライベートのことは把握していない。色々、謎に包まれた女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物腰や世間知らずさから、かなりのお嬢様なのではという説も（未確認）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"純粋で誰に対しても優しく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いきなりギュッて手を握ってまっすぐ目を見つめてきたりなど、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ナチュラルに人の心を奪ってくるような人たらしな素質がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異様に熱心な老人のファンがいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は読書。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お供魔法生物：ろっぷ（ウサギ）"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"98675"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23555","sourceWorkId":"31399","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23555","sourceWorkId":"31399","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"161 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23555","sourceWorkId":"31399","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23555","sourceWorkId":"31399","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23555","sourceWorkId":"31399","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8bcbad7b114c14d4273d39b47da96fb1079812ad779b47b65e6862995fb28f9a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/9239983abf0a63dc56ebf4d663e50f6e5ddad2cd0dfdc60cfe28f88e4d315c08.webp","width":142,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"戸板優衣","creatorId":"vndb:s10510","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10510","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10510","name":"戸板 優衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:342076:98675:24908:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c98855","characterName":"森野 球美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"98678","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"342076"},{"characterId":"98678","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"410165"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23556"],"vndbCharacterId":"c98855"},"originalCharacterName":"森野 球美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"524"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"It's kind of fateful. I'm thrilled.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an energetic member who moved to Tokyo from Kanazawa."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While working as an idol, she is also attending a culinary school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She also works part-time at a restaurant in a famous hotel in Tokyo."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a hard worker and spreads energy to everyone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she is overworked and has a hard time getting out of bed on her days off."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rumor has it that her reluctance to say \"no (ノー)\" clearly is the reason for this situation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She often recharges her energy by fluffing up her companion, Guri, a magical creature."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her specialty is cooking."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Accompanying magical creature: Guri (bear)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c98855"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"金沢から上京してきたはつらつ元気担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイドルをやりながら、調理師の専門学校に通っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"都内の有名ホテルのレストランでアルバイトもしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人一倍の頑張り屋さんで、皆に元気を振りまく存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でもオーバーワーク気味で、休みの日はベッドからなかなか出てこれない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ノー」とはっきりと言えない消極的な性格がこの状況を作っているとの噂も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よくお供の魔法生物ぐりをモフモフして元気を充電している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特技はお料理。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23556","sourceWorkId":"31399","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"グループの元気印で、みんなの妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は内気な常識人枠という二面性がチャームポイント(？)の、『けもの道』くまさん担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"くま系魔法生物の力を借りて変身する、くま魔法少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに、ライブのお決まり「がおー」は球美が言い出した(豆知識)。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夢は料理人で、地元の金沢でレストランをやるのが夢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイドルをやりながら、調理師の専門学校に通っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その上、都内の有名ホテル内のレストランでも修行している三足のわらじ状態。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『TOKYO NEW-DOLL FESTIVAL』出演に向けた準備も重なってきて、そろそろオーバーワークが隠しきれなくなりつつある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23556","sourceWorkId":"33694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"金沢から上京してきたはつらつ元気担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイドルをやりながら、調理師の専門学校に通っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上京してきて間もないのと、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"都内の有名ホテルのレストランでアルバイトもしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人一倍の頑張り屋さんで、皆に元気を振りまく存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でもオーバーワーク気味で、休みの日はベッドからなかなか出てこれない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ノー」とはっきりと言えない消極的な性格がこの状況を作っているとの噂も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よくお供の魔法生物ぐりをモフモフして元気を充電している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特技はお料理。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お供魔法生物：ぐり（熊）"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"98678"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23556","sourceWorkId":"31399","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23556","sourceWorkId":"31399","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"153 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23556","sourceWorkId":"31399","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23556","s